# EVAL ENGINEER role

- Offline harness replays against local closed-issue fixtures with known fixes.
- Report shortlist precision, reproduction success, and draft quality under `docs/`.
- Gate each milestone: harness must not regress.
- No live network writes in eval; use fixtures and recorded HTTP if needed.
- Keep a small fixtures project under `fixtures/` as the starting set.
